# The atomic invariants on named fields (vspec/atom.rs, vspec/count.rs):
# Arenas::count (NarenasPred), SlabTable::watermark (CommittedPred) and
# Policy::position (FracPred) are verified, each store writing a value in
# range; the watermark's permission wrappers and count.rs's swap are the
# same kind of primitive as the bound counts' and the bitmap words', and
# new_usize mints its permission as count.rs's new does. Third loom pass
# (verus/WEAKMEM.md, "Third pass"): the watermark wrappers, count.rs's
# store and swap, and its load, now excluding the orderings it panics for.
load_usize_in	atomics primitive	loom/GenMC	discharged (verus/seams/vspec-atom-load_usize_in.md)
store_usize	atomics primitive	loom/GenMC	discharged (verus/seams/vspec-atom-store_usize.md)
